          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_pyxis_station",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "By the early 2000s, hospitals nationwide began adopting automated dispensing cabinets known as Pyxis MedStation systems to regulate pharmaceuticals.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 8.34,
          "src_script": "2.06#1"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_pyxis_station",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "However, Charles Cullen quickly discovered a critical software vulnerability within the terminal's architecture.",
          "words_spoken": 13,
          "est_dur_s": 5.7,
          "src_script": "2.06#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_pyxis_drawer_ajar",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "He would enter requests for dangerous medications like Digoxin, Insulin, or Norepinephrine, but the moment the physical drawer released, he pressed the cancel button.",
          "words_spoken": 24,
          "est_dur_s": 10.53,
          "src_script": "2.06#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_pyxis_drawer_ajar",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The terminal logged the transaction as canceled and avoided billing the patient, yet the lethal vial was already concealed inside Cullen's pocket.",
          "words_spoken": 22,
          "est_dur_s": 9.65,
          "src_script": "2.06#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_pyxis_printout",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "At Somerset Medical Center, his behavioral inhibition collapsed entirely, leading him to target young, recovering patients slated for discharge.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 8.34,
          "src_script": "2.06#14"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_neutral_letter",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "In contrast, his psychological signature—the unchanging emotional gratification compelling his crimes—was his profound “God Complex”.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 5.96,
          "src_script": "2.08#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#8",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_institutional_bystander",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "He experienced a fleeting sense of omnipotence, imagining himself elevated above medicine and destiny as the sole arbiter of who survived.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 8.35,
          "src_script": "2.11#7"
        },
        {
