          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk04_somerset_exterior",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Autumn of 2003.",
          "words_spoken": 3,
          "est_dur_s": 1.08,
          "src_script": "1.03#1"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_somerset_exterior",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "At Somerset Medical Center in Somerville, New Jersey.",
          "words_spoken": 8,
          "est_dur_s": 2.88,
          "src_script": "1.03#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_icu_night",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The 43-year-old man possessed a frail frame, spoke in a quiet murmur, always greeted colleagues with a gentle smile, and eagerly volunteered to cover shifts for exhausted coworkers.",
          "words_spoken": 28,
          "est_dur_s": 10.06,
          "src_script": "1.03#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_cullen_silhouette",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Yet, beneath that pristine white scrubs lay a lethal “Halo Effect” that concealed a terrifying psychological abyss for 16 long years.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 7.55,
          "src_script": "1.03#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#6",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_code_blue_aftermath",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "He was always the first to rush in whenever a patient deteriorated, and quietly stayed behind to tidy up the room after failed resuscitations.",
          "words_spoken": 24,
          "est_dur_s": 8.63,
          "src_script": "1.05#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#7",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_breakroom_night",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "To all of us nurses at Somerset Medical Center, Charlie was simply an incredible friend.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 4.62,
          "src_script": "1.07#1"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#8",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_breakroom_night",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "He was considerate, never lost his temper, and cared for patients with exceptional gentleness.",
          "words_spoken": 14,
          "est_dur_s": 4.32,
          "src_script": "1.07#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#9",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_corridor_shadow",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Until the truth broke open, all of us felt a chill down our spines upon realizing we had worked alongside one of the most prolific serial killers in history.",
          "words_spoken": 29,
          "est_dur_s": 8.94,
          "src_script": "1.07#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#10",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_institutional_bystander",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Through the lens of criminal psychology, Charles Cullen exhibited classic hallmarks of psychological “Objectification” and severe dehumanization.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 6.76,
          "src_script": "2.11#1"
        },
        {
