          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_diner_exterior",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Their investigation led them directly to Amy Loughren—a skilled intensive care nurse and Charles Cullen's closest confidante.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 6.11,
          "src_script": "4.02#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_diner_booth",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "When we secretly met Amy Loughren outside the facility and laid Cullen's printed Pyxis access logs before her, she was utterly stunned.",
          "words_spoken": 22,
          "est_dur_s": 9.65,
          "src_script": "4.04#1"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_amy_scrubs",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "What made her position perilous was her personal vulnerability: a single mother battling severe cardiomyopathy that endangered her own life.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 8.78,
          "src_script": "4.04#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#5",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "fearful",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_amy_scrubs",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Terrified as I was for my own survival and my children's future, I knew staying silent would make me complicit in his murders.",
          "words_spoken": 23,
          "est_dur_s": 7.22,
          "src_script": "4.06#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_wire_closeup",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Amy Loughren entered the restaurant wearing a covert transmitter carefully concealed beneath her winter sweater by state detectives.",
          "words_spoken": 18,
          "est_dur_s": 6.47,
          "src_script": "4.08#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#7",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_diner_booth",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "With immense psychological dexterity, Amy gently broached the hospital anomalies and offered to help him find a way out.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 6.83,
          "src_script": "4.08#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#8",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_diner_booth",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "He slumped forward over the table, whispering words captured clearly on tape: “I want to stop, I want it all to be over.”",
          "words_spoken": 23,
          "est_dur_s": 8.27,
          "src_script": "4.08#8"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#9",
