          "bg": "tk04_somerset_exterior",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Somerset Medical Center was by no means his initial crime scene.",
          "words_spoken": 11,
          "est_dur_s": 4.83,
          "src_script": "1.14#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_ten_hospitals_map",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Across 16 years, from 1988 to 2003, Charles Cullen had worked across 9 different hospitals and 1 nursing home spanning New Jersey and Pennsylvania.",
          "words_spoken": 24,
          "est_dur_s": 10.53,
          "src_script": "1.14#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk04_ten_hospitals_map",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Wherever he took up employment, nighttime cardiac arrest fatalities consistently spiked along an anomalous statistical curve.",
          "words_spoken": 16,
          "est_dur_s": 7.02,
          "src_script": "1.14#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_neutral_letter",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Whenever suspicion mounted, he was quietly forced out with neutral references, allowing him to seamlessly transfer to another facility and resume his predatory trajectory.",
          "words_spoken": 24,
          "est_dur_s": 10.53,
          "src_script": "1.14#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_case_file_open",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "However, based on epidemiological reviews and massive unexplained medication deficits, investigative analysts believe the true toll could reach 400 lives.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 8.78,
          "src_script": "1.14#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_institutional_bystander",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "That systemic silence transformed institutions dedicated to healing into inadvertent sanctuaries for serial homicide across 16 years.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 6.76,
          "src_script": "5.05#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk04_courtroom_bench",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "In 2004, the Governor of New Jersey enacted the landmark Cullen Act to permanently dismantle dangerous institutional silence.",
          "words_spoken": 18,
          "est_dur_s": 7.9,
          "src_script": "5.06#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#9",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
